Author: zs <143140385+Zhangs-11@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Tue Sep 29 21:20:09 2026 +0800

    feat(chat): continue Markdown lists on new lines in the composer (#884)
    
    Inserting a line break inside a list item starts the next item: ordered
    numbers advance and keep their delimiter, bullets and task items repeat
    (checked tasks continue unchecked), and indentation is preserved. A line
    break on an empty item clears the marker and ends the list. Chinese
    enumerations such as "1、" continue as well.
    
    The composer listens for the textarea's native insertLineBreak input, so
    desktop Shift+Enter and mobile Enter share one path while sends and IME
    confirmations are untouched. Lines inside fenced code, thematic breaks and
    selections keep the native newline, and the edit stays on the undo stack.
    
    Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

